/target
**/target/
benchmarks/results/
# mdBook build output (`mdbook build docs/guide`).
docs/guide/book/
# Agent/dev worktrees (`git worktree add .worktrees/<name>`) are scratch checkouts
# of this same repo; never part of a commit.
/.worktrees/
# Local build and tool logs.
*.log
# The quickstart commits no lockfile: `cargo xtask external-check` seeds a copy
# from the workspace's on every run.
/examples/quickstart/Cargo.lock
